If you prefer to use "xdm" over "cde", you can change the following
runtime configuration variable in the /etc/rc.config file to reflect
your preference.

	XLOGIN="xdm"
	export XLOGIN

After editing the /etc/rc.config file, type the following for the 
changes to take affect:

	/sbin/init.d/xlogin restart

