> /etc/exports.  Remote file systems to be mounted go in:
>     /etc/fstab if they're to be normally mounted
>     /etc/auto.direct if they're to be automounted
> Make sure the variables in /etc/rc.config are correct;
> in particular, that NFSSERVING is 1 and NUM_NFSD is a
> reasonable number (8, unless you have a very lightly
> or very heavily loaded server).  You can disable the
> NFS server by setting NFSSERVING to 0.
