I use pmgrd data and feed it to MRTG through custom scripts to generate
daily, weekly, monthly and yearly graphs.  

Here is a sample script and config file for MRTG...
The get_pmgr.pl script:

#!/usr/bin/perl
$PMGR_SNMP_PORT=1167;
($input, $output, $uptime, $name)=`/usr/bin/getmany $ARGV[0] public
$ARGV[1] $ARGV[2] $ARGV[3] $ARGV[4] |cut -d= -f2 |/usr/bin/awk -F" "
'{print $1 $2 $3 $4}`;
print $input;
print $output;
print 0,"\n";
print $name;

Here is a sample for device interrupts from the mrtg config file:

