Eliud A. Puente wrote:
> 
> I am not write English very well!!!!!!!1
> 
> How i can define the size of my dtterm as default??
> i can  reduce the font size at session
> but i can't  define this value as default!!
> 

Create a file .Xdefaults in your $HOME-directory or add following
lines if you already have one:

! define the size of the dtterm-window in simbols
Dtterm*geometry:		80x45
! define the font
Dtterm*font:            	terminal10


Also, you can find more information in Dtterm->Help->Resourses


